  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "世界經濟—國際局勢與產業分析",
    "sub_ename": "WORLD-ECONOMY: INTERNATIONAL TRENDS AND INDUSTRY ANALYSIS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將深入探討國際經濟與產業發展的案例，分析地緣政治、全球供應鏈、技術變遷與政策博弈如何影響全球產業格局。透過跨國比較與情境模擬，培養學生掌握世界經濟脈動與產業趨勢的分析能力，理解台灣在其中的角色與挑戰。",
    "describe_eh": "This course offers in-depth exploration of international economic and industrial development cases, analyzing how geopolitics, global supply chains, technological shifts, and policy dynamics shape global industry patterns. Through cross-national comparisons and scenario simulations, students will develop analytical skills to grasp global economic trends and understand Taiwan’s position and challenges within them.",
